	<http://schema.org/name> "Abuse Accessibility Features" ;
	<http://schema.org/description> "A malicious app could abuse Android's accessibility features to capture sensitive data or perform other malicious actions, as demonstrated in a proof of concept created by Skycure (Citation: Skycure-Accessibility).  Platforms: Android" ;
