	<http://schema.org/name> "Local Network Configuration Discovery" ;
	<http://schema.org/description> "On Android, details of onboard network interfaces are accessible to apps through the java.net. (Citation: NetworkInterface) class (Citation: NetworkInterface). The Android  (Citation: TelephonyManager) class can be used to gather related information such as the IMSI, IMEI, and phone number (Citation: TelephonyManager).  Platforms: Android" ;
	<http://w3id.org/sepses/vocab/ref/attack#platform> "Android" ;
