	<http://schema.org/name> "Malicious Media Content" ;
	<http://schema.org/description> "Content of a media (audio or video) file could be designed to exploit vulnerabilities in parsers on the mobile device, as for example demonstrated by the Android Stagefright vulnerability (Citation: Zimperium-Stagefright).  Platforms: Android, iOS" ;
